{{Term/Store|Satori Mountain||Series, BotW, TotK}},{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref name="BotW Map"/><ref name="TotK Map"/> also known as the '''Strange Mountain''',{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="BotW Quince"/> is a recurring location in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Features and Overview==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Quests|
