====Korok Seeds====
[[File:BotW Korok Seed Icon.png|left|40px]]
A total of 15 [[Korok Seed Puzzle]]s are located on Satori Mountain. Each time Link solves one of these Puzzles, a [[Korok]] will appear nearby as a result. It will then give him a [[Korok Seed]] as a reward for finding it. Their locations are as follows:
* A [[Natural Hiding Spot]], taking the form of a [[Rock]] under a [[Pile of Leaves]] north of Rutile Lake.
* A Natural Hiding Spot, taking the form of a Rock hidden under a pile of bombable rocks north of Rutile Lake.
* A [[Flower Trail]] north of Rutile Lake.
* A [[Boulder]] that must be rolled into a hole south of the Mountain's peak.
* A Natural Hiding Spot, taking the form of a Rock underneath a Boulder south of the Stalnox.
* A [[Jar]] in a fallen Tree on the southern end of the Mountain, which Link must break using [[Archery]].
* A Natural Hiding Spot, taking the form of a Rock in a [[Tree Stump]] east of the Mountain's peak.
* [[Leaves with Fairy Dust]] on top of a dead [[Cedar Tree]] near the [[Apple]] Tree grove.
* A Jar in a large Tree's hollow on the Mountain's eastern end.
* A group of [[Balloon]]s that appear when Link stands near the [[Pinwheel]] on the northeast side of the Mountain.
* A [[Rock Pattern]] west of Satori Mountain's peak.
* A Natural Hiding Spot, taking the form of a Rock in the cherry blossom Tree.
* A Natural Hiding Spot, taking the form of a Rock under a Pile of Leaves near Mogg Latan Shrine.
* A Flower Trail starting at the Mountain's peak.
* A [[Race (Mechanic)|Race]], which starts near the Mountain's Stalnox.

