====Treasure Chests====
Many Treasure Chests can be found throughout Satori Mountain. In total, these Chests contains one [[Opal]], one [[Topaz]], one [[Forest Dweller's Spear]], one [[Forest Dweller's Bow]], five [[Ice Arrow]]s, one [[Purple Rupee]], and two [[Silver Rupee]]s.

